  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/zipball/v2.6.0",
  "body": "## [2.6.0] - 2026-10-10\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Luau: Added support for `if local` / `if const` condition bindings in both `if` statements and `if` expressions (e.g. `if local x = getValue() then ... end`)\r\n- Added `Input` mode for `collapse_simple_statement`, preserving whether simple statements are single-line or multi-line in the input while still formatting their contents ([#1112](https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1112))\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fixed range formatting indenting statements one level too shallow when nested inside a function expression within a table constructor ([#1145](https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/issues/1145))\r\n- Fixed `-- stylua: ignore start`/`end` ranges inside multiline tables reformatting the ignored fields ([#1134](https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/issues/1134))\r\n- When using range formatting, semicolons outside of the provided range are no longer incorrectly formatted ([#1147](https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/issues/1147))\r\n- Luau: Fixed sort requires not recognizing imports declared with `const`, e.g. `const Foo = require(path)`\r\n- Luau: Fixed the `read`/`write` access modifier merging into the element type in array type shorthand, changing the meaning of the code (`{ read Foo }` was formatted as `{ readFoo }`) ([#1126](https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/issues/1126))\r\n- Fixed single-line comments in CRLF files gaining an extra carriage return (`\\r\\r\\n`) on every format when `line_endings = \"Windows\"`, and keeping their original `\\r\\n` when formatting to Unix line endings ([#1167](https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1167))\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## External Contributions\r\n* Mention conform.nvim as a Neovim formatter plugin that supports stylua by @alerque in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1124\r\n* Clarify the syntax for command-line formatting configuration by @kormide in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1132\r\n* Fix sort_requires not recognizing `const` imports in luau by @ddashdev in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1123\r\n* Fix Luau array access modifier formatting by @Companion in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1148\r\n* Keep out-of-range semicolons when formatting a range by @GhostCoder6969 in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1158\r\n* support if-local and if-const by @annieetang in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1160\r\n* Add Input mode for collapse_simple_statement by @ddashdev in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1112\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @kormide made their first contribution in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1132\r\n* @ddashdev made their first contribution in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1123\r\n* @Companion made their first contribution in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1148\r\n* @GhostCoder6969 made their first contribution in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1158\r\n* @annieetang made their first contribution in https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/pull/1160\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/StyLua/compare/v2.5.2...v2.6.0",
